// rule_name: bloodhound_collection_archive_creation
// severity: medium
// procedure_ids: BH-015
// description: Correlates multiple JSON or CSV file creations with archive creation by one process.
// log_source_prerequisites: EDR or Sysmon file create/delete events with stable process entity, path and extension.
// false_positives: Backup, export, packaging, browser download and administrative reporting software.
// references: reports/bloodhound/source-analysis.md, public-rules/comparisons/bloodhound/bloodhound_collection_archive_creation.md
// assumptions_and_gaps: Candidate retrieval is translated; canonical entity joins, ordering, windows, and cardinality must be implemented and tested in the target backend.
// schema_profile: schemas/elastic-ecs.yml
// ECS assumption: event.code carries product IDs and event.action carries normalized event types.
any where event.code in ("*") or event.action in ("*")
